  "description": "Please find below the current configuration for the Asterisk\u2011MQTT bridge. The Asterisk server is reachable at **asterisk.example.com** on port **5038**, using the credentials user **admin** and password **SecretAsteriskPass123!**. The system is set to generate a single event per call (singleeventpercall = true). The MQTT broker is located at **mqtt://broker.example.com:1883** and requires the login **mqtt_user** with the password **MqttSecretPass456!**.\n\nLine definitions are as follows: the first line uses channel **SIP/1001** and is marked as non\u2011internal. It hosts two DID entries. The first DID (**id: did-001**) is **5551234567**, supports outbound dialing (candial = true), and publishes commands to **asterisk/did/5551234567/command** while status updates appear on **asterisk/did/5551234567/status**. The second DID (**id: did-002**) is **5559876543**, does not support dialing (candial = false), with its command and status topics set to **asterisk/did/5559876543/command** and **asterisk/did/5559876543/status** respectively. The second line uses channel **SIP/2002**, is marked as internal, and contains a single DID (**id: did-003**) numbered **5551112222**. This DID allows dialing (candial = true) and uses the command topic **asterisk/did/5551112222/command** and status topic **asterisk/did/5551112222/status**.",
  "reference_json": {
    "asterisk": {
      "host": "asterisk.example.com",
      "password": "SecretAsteriskPass123!",
      "port": "5038",
      "singleeventpercall": true,
      "user": "admin"
    },
    "lines": [
      {
        "channel": "SIP/1001",
        "internal": false,
        "dids": [
          {
            "did": "5551234567",
            "command_topic": "asterisk/did/5551234567/command",
            "status_topic": "asterisk/did/5551234567/status",
            "candial": true,
            "id": "did-001"
          },
          {
            "did": "5559876543",
            "command_topic": "asterisk/did/5559876543/command",
            "status_topic": "asterisk/did/5559876543/status",
            "candial": false,
            "id": "did-002"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "channel": "SIP/2002",
        "internal": true,
        "dids": [
          {
            "did": "5551112222",
            "command_topic": "asterisk/did/5551112222/command",
            "status_topic": "asterisk/did/5551112222/status",
            "candial": true,
            "id": "did-003"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "mqtt": {
      "url": "mqtt://broker.example.com:1883",
      "username": "mqtt_user",
      "password": "MqttSecretPass456!"
    }
  }
